WEBVTT

00:10:00.542 --> 00:10:03.268
So partly as a result of this,

00:10:03.292 --> 00:10:05.393
the United States of America became

00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:11.809
the only major developed society

00:10:11.833 --> 00:10:17.601
where the average income
of the bottom 50 percent --

00:10:17.625 --> 00:10:20.976
yes, 50 percent --

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:26.101
average income went down
over a 30-year period,

00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:29.167
from 1980 to 2010.